{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cb39625ac2b518f880f37a765ea40ab99f5bc64258804ec8bd843cb40b241257",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:592663f635343669353d5c542a92586a55e64cacd36c579211ad3384b7ee26cd",
      "text": "Beit的‘绝招粉丝福利’？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e18bc968294ed1f197097b9206f7448b7016830db1c71b0f5ea1368831d6fdc",
      "text": "是的。冬马先生说，\n想作为《成为万物的万人迷！》的参考。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cd8050d34d861f89a3cc63cfa9d7e6e75df0df566614553fd837134303c510c",
      "text": "要是那个的话，我最喜欢恭二和实微笑了！\n是Beit的绝招！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:911bea802e8c4c8329a3cc8367f403c3449dc3f9423bf97a6a65832280defc8e",
      "text": "谢谢你，皮埃尔。\n我也最喜欢皮埃尔的笑容了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96a50293580b8159580588c953430f49bf33f16d1362cf896d35467afd89f810",
      "text": "还有，实的眨眼，恭二的飞吻！\n恭二最近练了好多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97c0fce1672b6bf7ad78cf5adf3508a6907a3456266a1e3bcee8db87ec2ba106",
      "text": "哎，毕竟是他们两个人教我的嘛。\n虽然我也不确定到底做得像不像样就是了……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30add3ce053290067555a685b6ba95a61f861950b8625e7167844b7c5a5f8ae5",
      "text": "我……挺喜欢皮埃尔向粉丝挥手的动作呢。\n连带着我自己都会忍不住微笑起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d82116873b4dac832f1b2d5c2cb6f3cd1b5948fb2a63fea578395536e6130734",
      "text": "嗯嗯，我懂。那个笑容和挥手的姿态，\n能让人感受到只有皮埃尔才能展现出的高贵气质呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de92809d06bab32bf207fa05465a05a647247c0fb1f6bc452999748e08d13367",
      "text": "嘿嘿……谢谢。我会更加努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c76b496c892a9a29de2c01b2817f25d9c347f6fc3173ee35dd79eec922e64c72",
      "text": "我觉得大家作为偶像，\n在这短短的时间里都有了很大的成长哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51a8beee9967d7926532998cc23655c1204056c51f8ffba79ab3beced4602cdd",
      "text": "真的吗？谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:432179edc2abfda395f7ff141270386053af3d424b9b070f92f4387f4b95b1d5",
      "text": "冬马先生虽然来请教我们……。\n但Jupiter也很厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
